Swagger UI 5.34.1, vendored from the swagger-ui-dist npm package.

  Tarball:   https://registry.npmjs.org/swagger-ui-dist/-/swagger-ui-dist-5.34.1.tgz
  Integrity: sha512-VSr8fXfI93obYaQicLJbLUKGRxDojj/SfRJDDLCioGTUBj4BK/Nj4eE9jCeCAnJxVLi7iS+08PbiZLyrQKBkJQ==

The files here are copied unchanged from the tarball's package/ directory:
swagger-ui-bundle.js, swagger-ui-standalone-preset.js, swagger-ui.css,
their *.LICENSE.txt notices, LICENSE and NOTICE.

Licences: Swagger UI is Apache-2.0 (LICENSE, NOTICE). The bundles also
contain third-party code under MIT, BSD-3-Clause (ieee754) and
Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0 (DOMPurify), listed in the *.LICENSE.txt files.
These are minified builds; the sources are in the swagger-ui repository
(https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui) at tag v5.34.1.

To update: download the new tarball, check its integrity against the
registry (npm view swagger-ui-dist@<version> dist.integrity), copy the
same files over these ones, and update this README and the version in
httpbin/core.py.
